{"articleNo":"121908","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=121908&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015-1 국가2유형, 지방인재 장학금 우선감면 안내(신입생)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.01.29","hit":"4473","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#005766\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">■ 국가장학금(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">Ⅱ)유형, 지방인재 장학금 지급기준</span></strong></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 국가장학금 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">Ⅱ유형</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙지원대상 : 소득8분위 이하</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">소득분위 6분위 일부금액(공학기준 255천원)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;장애인 등록금 범위 내 전액지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">기타 우대분야 : 다자녀 500,000원(한국장학재단에 대상자로 등록된 학생)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 지방인재 장학금</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙</span> 지급대상 :<font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> <font>'15년도 신입생 </font></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1년간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ </span>지원금액 : 등록금 전액지원(우선감면)</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙</span> 지원대상 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- '15년도 신입생, 국가장학금 신청자(소득분위가 확인된 자)에 한하여 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" color=\"#ff00dd\">★&nbsp;국가장학금을 신청하지 않은 지방인재 장학생은 국가장학금 2차 신청기한('15.2.26~3.11) </font><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">내 꼭 신청을&nbsp; 해야 정상 지급 됨을 알려드립니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 1학기 선발학생이 12학점 이상 이수, 100점 만점의 85점 이상 취득한 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 경우&nbsp;&nbsp;2학기 장학금 계속지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⊙ 선발기준</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 입학성적 우수 : 모집유형별 입학성적 순 선발(45명)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 성적기준</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (수시) 고교석차 2등급이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 고등학교 3학년 1학기 까지 이수한&nbsp;과목 중 1/2이상 2등급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : 내신이수과목 : 9등급으로 관리되지 않는 과목은 이수과목에서 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (수능) 2개 영역이상 2등급 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: 수능영역(언어/수리/외국어(영어), 기타(탐구 및 제2외국어 등) 중</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2개영역이상 2등급이내&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 기타영역은 2개과목에서 2등급 이내 충족시 1개영역으로 인정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 입학성적우수 선발은 검정고시 등 과목별 내신성적 또는 수능성적을</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 확인할 수 있는 경우에만 선발</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 예외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;: 특성화학부별 입학성적순 우선선발(19명)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;성적기준 입학성적 우수와 동일</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 기계시스템공학과는 1학년 2학기에 학과를 배정하므로 기계계열</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생대상으로 선발</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2015.1. 29</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학 생 처 장</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
